
                            	<h3><u>Ale rasool kucha-o bazaar ya ali</u></h3>
                <div style="width:100%">
                                <p><p><strong><u>Ale rasool kucha-o bazaar ya ali</u></strong></p>

<p>(Sarkaar ya ali) x2</p>

<p>aale rasul kuch-o bazaar ya</p>

<p>roti to hogi aap ki talwar ya ali</p>

<p>aale rasul.</p>

<p>Shahzadiyawo ke sar pe ridaye nahi rahi,</p>

<p>Bacho ke pas bacho ki mayen nahi rahi,</p>

<p>(khushya to kya khushi ki) x2</p>

<p>hawaye nahi rahi,</p>

<p>luti gayi hai aap ki sarkar ya ali</p>

<p>aale rasul.</p>

<p>Abbas jo hussain ke lashkar ki aas tha,</p>

<p>Lagta tha saath hai jab tak wo paas tha,</p>

<p>(na khof koi tha) x2</p>

<p>kisi ko ye raas tha,</p>

<p>utha hai sar se saaya-e-diwarya ali</p>

<p>aale rasul.</p>

<p>Chini gayi sitam se sakina ki baliyan,</p>

<p>Rukhsar par namaya tamacho ke hai nishan,</p>

<p>(shimre layin jo bacho ko) x2</p>

<p>deta hai gurkiya,</p>

<p>maktal mein kaap ta hai alamdar ya ali</p>

<p>aale rasul.</p>

<p>Ab shaam ka safar aur nabi ki nawasiyan,</p>

<p>Pahne huwe hai sayade sajad beriyan,</p>

<p>(zalim jo leke aaye hai) x2</p>

<p>lasho ke darmiyan,</p>

<p>ankho se khun bahaata hai bimar ya ali</p>

<p>aale rasul.</p>

<p>Wo dekho buzuwo me hai zainab ke resuma,</p>

<p>Sar nange jiski maa ko na dekhe hai aasmaa,</p>

<p>(balwe me sar khule hai) x2</p>

<p>wo makhdumiye jahan,</p>

<p>koi nahi hai muniso ghamkhwar ya ali</p>

<p>aale rasul.</p>

<p>Zehra lahad ko chor ke yasrab aayi hai,</p>

<p>Faryad apne lab pe khadija bhi laayi hai</p>

<p>(makhtul karbala me) x2</p>

<p>jo zainab ki bhayi hai,</p>

<p>mara gaya khuld ke sardar ya ali</p>

<p>aale rasul.</p>

<p>Bazu kalam huwe alam hai lahu lahi,</p>

<p>Asger ki khun se kar liya shabbir ne wudhu,</p>

<p>(faili huwi hai gham) x2</p>

<p>fiza aisi charsu,</p>

<p>jisme hai sans lena bhi dushwar ya ali</p>

<p>aale rasul.</p>

<p>(Roti to hogi aap ki)x2</p>

<p>talwar ya ali</p>

<p>aale rasul.</p>
</p>